Complete the file-level audit of the supplied live-system archive and populate the upgrade gap matrix.

Only after that should the team finalize implementation tickets, affected files, test cases and release order.

**Final target:** One ERP in which production, stock, sales, collections, expenses and accounting reconcile to the same traceable business transactions, with reliable calculations and clear daily workflows.
